+    "badDrugs": ["Dantrolene"], 
+    "coMin": 1, 
+    "debriefMsg": "\nYou must become adept at the differential diagnosis of hypotension under anesthesia. Think: (1) Preload, (2) Pump, (3) Afterload.  In this case it is the pump (contractility).\n\n", 
+    "depthCarina": 25, 
