+    "debriefMsg": "\nFollow the procedures for rapid sequence induction of general anesthesia: preoxygenate, apply cricoid pressure, administer a bolus of hypnotic agent such as propofol, administer succinylcholine and intubate; release cricoid pressure after confirming correct placementof the endotracheal tube.\n\n", 
