+    "debriefMsg": "In this simulation you should learn to recognize the clinical presentation of malignant hyperthermia and distinguish from other causes of hyperpyrexia.\n\nYou must treat aggressively by discontinuing the inhalation anesthetic agent, securing the airway, hyperventilating with 100% oxygen, rapid administration of cold saline and administration of dantrolene. To make the simulation even more challenging, hold the dantrolene for 20 minutes and try stabilizing the patient until the dantrolene is available. You can also successfully complete this case by avoiding potent inhalation agent and succinylcholine, but you will learn more about the management of MH crisis if you trigger the reaction.", 
+    "depthCarina": 25, 
+    "depthCords": 18, 
+    "depthTubeInitial": 22, 
